        <item>
            <title>Habla 0.1.8</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 06:20:41 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixes dictation coming back silent after using the Notetaker, and shows a clear message (and resets the mic) if your microphone ever sends no sound. Triple-tapping Control no longer starts the Notetaker unless you switch it on in Settings.</p>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Jason9347/habla-releases/releases/download/v0.1.8/Habla-0.1.8.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="aOkfAYtHiv5bMiJeNCd1xNfW37/pEM/PHZS0xRHx9EbL9UkeHMX+Hp3HwaO3jUHhyYr+XhG2ZwutmP/DMZdsCA==" length="44354623"/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Habla 0.1.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 05:05:36 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixes dictation sometimes pasting what you last copied instead of what you said (in slower apps like Claude). Gmail and Outlook in your browser now get email formatting. Updates now announce themselves. Stats count only what you dictate in Habla. Clearer reasons to sign in, and a Keep me posted option to follow along and support Habla.</p>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/Jason9347/habla-releases/releases/download/v0.1.7/Habla-0.1.7.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="DmXo0dwL7QkUdu1YXSNGGG3WBIqVCZwfPPixpZOROK4Trta3oh7H4mFhIM4iGlf2dr6iz7lYXMih0RQz5qw2AQ==" length="44354254"/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Habla 0.1.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:38:28 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Habla accounts: sign in with Apple or an email code to use Habla's free AI. Your usage follows you across your Macs. Dictation still works without an account.</p>]]></description>
