            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>No API key needed: setup now confirms Habla's shared AI is on instead of asking for a key. New, clearer install window.</p>]]></description>
