            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Habla's AI now works without an Anthropic key: clean-up, Instruct Mode, Transforms and meeting notes use Habla's shared AI, with a fair daily limit. Add your own key in Settings for unlimited use.</p>]]></description>
